      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b2821f1443b6a55287c67ad|full_name}: avtr_86207aaf-37d2-4d15-bdc9-b10588815a6e\navtr_382fe31c-a218-4bc4-9323-f6f62bca8074\navtr_cd2b5a60-2156-495e-8b59-0d0d50d759fa\n(It happens to more avatars than this, these were just the quickest IDs we could grab that the bug happened to)\nWe have managed to reproduce the results by doing the following.\n1. Have two people look at each other with a 3.0 avatar.\n2. have one person turn away and look in the opposite direction.\n3. have the person that didn't turn around reload or reset their avatar.\n4. have the person turn back around.\nThe person that reloaded their avatar will be broken and animation will no longer play on that character, even if they reload or reset their avatar again.\nEdit: we just did some more testing and it doesn't appear to be consistent.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
