      "value": "@{5b2821f1443b6a55287c67ad|full_name}: I believe the issue may requires FBT to trigger. (Edit or not? didn't seem to trigger when I was in non FBT, but other comments suggest otherwise)\nit also occurs with every 3.0 avatar I've seen (those I've made, those I've uploaded from unity packages, My friends models, random 3.0 avatars found in worlds have all had the issue in some form)\nSee https://vrchat.canny.io/avatar-30/p/bug-1005-playable-layers-only-play-for-the-player-no-one-else-can-see-any-of-the aswell",
